0,Tobati language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobati_language,"Tobati permits three consonants in the onset, and at most a single consonant or a nasal–stop cluster in the coda. Nasal–stop clusters only permit a nasal and a stop of the same place of articulation.",Tobati,Austronesian
